SELECT '47ad4991-89ca-4398-8bfd-c5e292ed07b3',id,user_id,'user','revision','Automated acceptance feedback from independent checks of the earlier v001 draft (keep the 20-slide scope and preserve earlier files): please incorporate these concrete interaction repairs in your current revision. (1) In cnn-05-scan, all four output cells currently share the same fill predicate position[0]==0, so two scan steps light every cell and two light none. Bind each output-cell highlight to BOTH its row and column, and visibly highlight the corresponding moving 2x2 patch in the input matrix. Capture all four distinct scan positions and check that exactly the current output cell and matching input patch are highlighted. (2) The shared Step and Scrub controls in scenes 04,05,10,13,16 set playhead without seeking TimelineEngine. A direct engine replay of the actual scene actions showed Step -> playhead=1000, lesson.step=1, timeline.time=0; Play+16ms then jumped back to playhead=16 and step=0 instead of continuing at1016/step1. Scrub2000 -> Play had the same reset. Use the runtime seekTimeline action (and pause where appropriate) for manual timeline movement, so Play continues from the displayed position. Test Step->Play, Scrub->Play, Pause, and Reset continuity against the actual action sequence. (3) Where mechanism animation is linked to Monaco source, highlight the real current multiply/accumulate/store operation rather than keeping a constant line number (v001 scan used line30 and backward used line46). Check highlights against the actual displayed source and meaningful intermediate animation states. These findings refer to the preserved v001 scan SHA edf17e4d5208cb75a75afc56f1d0b69a23e6dacf2c95606c93d12626673be8f5; if your current revision already fixes them, verify and retain it. Keep audit terminology in reports, not slide copy.','[]','pending',CAST(strftime('%s','now') AS INTEGER) * 1000,CAST(strftime('%s','now') AS INTEGER) * 1000
FROM jobs WHERE id='db69fb9d-5d27-4fc2-9553-a722e2a5acbc' AND status='running' AND user_id=(SELECT user_id FROM jobs WHERE id='2d8c4072-7aee-4f55-8fb0-8f074de4f8cb' AND title='介绍cnn')
AND (SELECT COUNT(*) FROM task_messages WHERE job_id='db69fb9d-5d27-4fc2-9553-a722e2a5acbc')<1000
ON CONFLICT(job_id,id) DO NOTHING;
